[1.754724, "o", "- **Rebase:** rebased onto `origin/orka-demo/base`. The only conflict was in \r\n`deploy/utils/README.md`, where the base and the PR each added a line in the same spot. I kept \r\nboth lines (`convert_api_version.py`, then `quantity.py`).\r\n- **Semantic check:** nothing to adjust, because the PR doesn't apply a rule across a group of \r\nfiles.\r\n- **Validation:** `pre-commit run --from-ref origin/orka-demo/base --to-ref HEAD` passed, and \r\n`pytest deploy/utils/tests/test_quantity.py` passed (13 tests). Both commits are signed and signed \r\noff.\r\n"]
