[1.754756, "o", "- **Evidence:** the job failed in its \"Clean up previous unsigned-commits comments\" step because \r\n`GH_TOKEN` was empty in the fork. That workflow doesn't test the code.\r\n- **Now:** it didn't run on the new head. The sandbox check `orka-demo-ci`, Lint PR and Label PR \r\nall pass at `88d6e91`.\r\n\r\n**Seen while rebasing, outside this run's scope:** in `quantity.py`, the `M` and `G` suffixes use \r\npowers of 1024 instead of 1000. That contradicts the PR's own docstring, and none of the tests \r\ncover `M` or `G`. A review run should pick this up.\r\n"]
